# Allowlist: the build context is the repo root, which also holds docker/conf (WireGuard
# private keys), docker/data (settings incl. the Gluetun API key) and other local files.
# Send only what the Dockerfile COPYs.
*
!airbl/
!main.py
!requirements.txt
!docker/entrypoint.sh
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

# Local project docs, Claude memory & dev tooling (not committed by default)
_claude/
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/
.DS_Store
